      "text": "A table titled \"EPI: Outreach immunization sessions completion by orgunit - this and last 5 years\", giving the percentage of outreach immunization sessions conducted for Trainingland, Animal Region and Food Region by year. The first two year columns are empty and every other cell is 0; the year headings are too blurred to read reliably.",
